{"id":"3d8b7bfede3b786f","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-comp-mu-recursive-operator.md","title":"ZFC Comp Mu Recursive Operator","display":"df-zfc-comp-mu-recursive-operator — ZFC Comp Mu Recursive Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comp-mu-recursive-operator","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comp-mu-recursive-operator"],"display":"df-zfc-comp-mu-recursive-operator — ZFC Comp Mu Recursive Operator","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comp-mu-recursive-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comp-mu-recursive-operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comp-mu-recursive-operator — ZFC Comp Mu Recursive Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span> (arity)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\omega^{\\omega^{k+1}}\">\\(f\\in\\omega^{\\omega^{k+1}}\\)</span> (total search function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\subseteq\\omega^k\\times\\omega\">\\(g\\subseteq\\omega^k\\times\\omega\\)</span> (candidate graph of the partial result function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MuOperator}\">\\(\\operatorname{MuOperator}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comp\\text{-}mu\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\operatorname{MuOperator}(g,f,k)\\leftrightarrow k\\in\\omega\\land f\\in\\omega^{\\omega^{k+1}}\\land g=\\{\\langle\\vec x,y\\rangle\\in\\omega^k\\times\\omega:f(\\vec x,y)=0\\land\\forall z&lt;y\\;(f(\\vec x,z)\\neq0)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comp\\text{-}mu\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\operatorname{MuOperator}(g,f,k)\\leftrightarrow k\\in\\omega\\land f\\in\\omega^{\\omega^{k+1}}\\land g=\\{\\langle\\vec x,y\\rangle\\in\\omega^k\\times\\omega:f(\\vec x,y)=0\\land\\forall z&lt;y\\;(f(\\vec x,z)\\neq0)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The displayed graph contains exactly one pair for each input for which a zero exists, namely the pair with the least such witness. Writing the graph extensionally avoids applying function notation to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> before functionality has been established.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\omega^{\\omega^{k+1}}","display":false},{"tex":"g\\subseteq\\omega^k\\times\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MuOperator}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comp\\text{-}mu\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\operatorname{MuOperator}(g,f,k)\\leftrightarrow k\\in\\omega\\land f\\in\\omega^{\\omega^{k+1}}\\land g=\\{\\langle\\vec x,y\\rangle\\in\\omega^k\\times\\omega:f(\\vec x,y)=0\\land\\forall z<y\\;(f(\\vec x,z)\\neq0)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"g","display":false}],"bytes":1159,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1758","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-comp-mu-recursive-operator.md|58-df-zfc-comp-mu-recursive-operator]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751"]}